config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_TASMOTA_H801
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Tasmota H801"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	default n
	help
		control of the H801 LED controllers (and of the Tasmota devices with PWM channels) from Domoticz (it ships its own MQTT client and the device controllers).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/h801-tasmota-plugin, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> Tasmota H801, enter the MQTT broker.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
